# Health Arabia

Medical recruitment platform connecting doctors with healthcare facilities in the GCC, with the platform (ALMAHER) mediating reviews and hiring.

## Stack (pnpm workspace monorepo)

- `apps/web`: Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript, public website, port 3000.
- `apps/dashboard`: React + Vite + TypeScript, doctor/facility/platform dashboards, port 5173.
- `apps/api`: NestJS + TypeScript, routes under `/api`, port 4000.
- PostgreSQL (Docker, `docker-compose.yml`) + Prisma (`apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma`).
- Use `pnpm` only. Run app commands from the root via the scripts in `package.json`.
- Never commit `.env` files; update the matching `.env.example` when adding a variable.
- Add path-scoped rules under `.cursor/rules/` per app instead of growing this file.

