## Confirmed product rules (stakeholder-provided)

- Doctor and facility accounts require platform approval before use.
- Facilities submit jobs; the platform approves them before publication.
- Doctors can apply only after account approval.
- Facilities see applicants anonymously: job title, specialty, years of experience only.
- Facilities can request to hire one, several, or all applicants of a job; each selected applicant has their own request and stays anonymous.
- After private platform-facility agreement, the platform reveals the doctor's details and opens a group chat (doctor, facility, platform).
- One account per facility; recruitment officer details are collected at registration.
- The home "Upload Your CV" banner is for a registered doctor who has not uploaded a CV.

When the Figma design conflicts with these rules, follow the rules and report the conflict.
